0c89c263" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="da187048-adf5-4b74-9bca-50acbecdec63" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="ca31cbcf-73f5-43f0-8cb4-92e8419ad3ff"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="89ccf005-2496-447a-a9ac-94cf365497f6"><p data-ref="03f48022-bbf0-43fb-85b5-59c1a30312e5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program to show multilevel inheritance to manage student information and calculate their marks. The program should include the following functionalities:</p><p data-ref="bad0351d-a144-4067-84f7-10b494dd3fcf" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="791dcb69-71ef-4de3-abe2-b2299c75cd1b">Student Class:</strong></p><p data-ref="541f6f2a-4b9a-489d-9ed1-321ab2097d5a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">This class should contain two attributes:</p><ul data-ref="2e80aef3-8261-43c4-8015-007ba28c8c41" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="8fb672e8-2326-4d97-80b0-1e8be8833f9b"><strong data-ref="f717198f-4c4d-44c6-89e0-179ab5804704">id (int)</strong>: Represents the student's ID.</li><li data-ref="0c05d759-34f4-45df-a736-b35d27dc792f"><strong data-ref="5c8a2a90-44ea-440d-aa3b-f34be7f6c278">name (String):</strong> Represents the student's name.</li></ul><p data-ref="8145720c-fd13-4e10-8b7d-ddb96781872e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Methods:</p><ul data-ref="b7427319-b98d-40c0-b721-036b8cfa2903" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="3eb5b652-cea8-4edd-a01b-bb984e9555b1"><strong data-ref="5808e4a5-fe40-4210-b928-05e792a18a18">setData(int id, String name): </strong>To set the student's ID and name.</li><li data-ref="1fa474dc-1ed8-4304-82e3-d3b14e5f9a06"><strong data-ref="099b13a9-a652-4d64-a6ce-4a2502e15a61">displayData():</strong> To display the student's ID and name.</li></ul><p data-ref="d21fa7d2-2966-4c34-8d3a-9986ba13d30e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0"