om:1px solid black;" data-ref="e94da35c-e34d-4c65-a70f-5721f9ac15e9" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="26a88a3c-9bc9-48e1-8593-bd10379483a1"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="7998a59f-f3dc-4bbd-bcfe-1bdcf595cb50"><p data-ref="a2139e61-388b-4840-b8d3-6b9b84470a33" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Design an abstract class named <strong data-ref="001e4657-b9f8-497e-8938-28884cb74931">Shape</strong> to represent geometric shapes. The <strong data-ref="599eed03-aec0-49b4-b0ca-ce702e909083">Shape</strong> class should declare the following abstract methods:</p><ul data-ref="e1d2636e-62bb-4395-916c-ca10220131ca" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="824beb05-4956-45b1-a743-12f17e4f53b0"><strong data-ref="b17eb565-866e-4328-a785-d981a89bb0e6">double calculateArea(</strong>): Calculates and returns the area of the shape.</li><li data-ref="a1cd29c2-157b-4619-baba-d55ab2c8d5ad"><strong data-ref="9ec15e6d-bb7b-4b8d-bcae-be25771cff96">double calculatePerimeter()</strong>: Calculates and returns the perimeter of the shape.</li></ul><p data-ref="191581a6-65e1-4af7-a396-7110d58caf7c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">In addition, implement a concrete method named <strong data-ref="c268ff03-8950-488d-bc65-bc31fd4feab7">displayDetails()</strong> that displays the area and perimeter of the shape. Create a subclass named <strong data-ref="53b2f9fa-92e1-49ce-ab4f-8398a6268094">Circle</strong> that extends the <strong data-ref="f16977d6-3837-4f38-8791-d364f4a5b66a">Shape</strong> class.</p><p data-ref="a546938c-d16a-4ade-a8b1-cec3bb7bffa7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="cb7fa42f-49d5-440a-a178-8f3ba1551de7"></p><p data-ref="a835c59f-3f40-4bbe-90e2-7cc5ad0b1ad7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The <strong data-ref="338cda96-1f8c-489f-a772-fef84c8d40c2">Circle</strong> class should:</p><ul data-ref="464e42b4-c4ba-44ea-9c64-919a48872118" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="27a55efb-1a74-421a-b052-fb5880c35b00">Store the radius of the circle.</li><li data-ref="ff939625-18e9-4868-af69-69f8333cfc57