style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="0ed4763e-5958-4417-84c4-75887b03a4dd" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="3980dc84-37a3-4c3f-b765-4dd7a02457fb"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="4a66f7df-41a7-4688-a525-753c53cbc3e0"><p data-ref="0e85d7f8-60c4-4386-9345-c8a42a733b0f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">You are required to implement the <strong data-ref="9a55cc95-4294-4860-b829-e775542ba19e">Circle</strong> class, which demonstrates multiple inheritance using interfaces. The provided <strong data-ref="2ae4baf6-0a61-41c8-8617-dab996f04180">Shape</strong> and <strong data-ref="1a689e79-ac73-4898-8bfc-18ad22911c0e">Color</strong> interfaces define methods that need to be implemented within the <strong data-ref="82085df4-f323-47c0-879b-c080cdba5415">Circle</strong> class.</p><p data-ref="82fd42f6-0904-4e8a-b214-0932e850bf28" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="6912dadf-6681-4fee-b818-de0830d7e462"></p><p data-ref="ee864b69-d144-49a2-ac90-c632e78eaf96" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">1. <strong data-ref="114eaa0a-7b2b-4906-a8a2-2e6e5e55328d">Shape</strong> Interface:</p><p data-ref="606c701f-dce7-478e-9760-ea9e2587529a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The <strong data-ref="144f31f9-a284-4243-a022-b59099d27ee9">Shape</strong> Interface contains two methods:</p><ul data-ref="e13ea1ed-a301-491d-9af3-8ea76b82f7be" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="09401d62-f01d-4140-ba49-00baeecb56fd"><strong data-ref="3d089df3-b6ed-453f-983e-4e0ca69560b6">double calculateArea():</strong> To calculate the area of the circle.</li><li data-ref="3869e083-157d-40f4-8901-5c6cc15bc6cf"><strong data-ref="a5c9d8a3-201c-44bc-883c-7feca539d924">double calculatePerimeter():</strong> To calculate the perimeter of the circle.</li></ul><p data-ref="e464ef75-6a1f-45ab-a409-8e095f8c6fe0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The <strong data-ref="03b4f5ca-c85d-4cfc-84f6-703881c40897">Color</strong> Interface contains one method:</p><ul data-ref="84543b37-105a-4d20-be5e-4d25c4256e4b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="64f8e155-4285-4e2b-b203-30e2c6f76ff2"><strong data-ref="526484e7-e09b-4eae-a70d-6f271bf3c325">String getColor():</strong> To get the color of the circle.</li></ul><p data-ref="a9b58cad-43e5-447f-a8ed-85506cf007e0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="bae3a3a5-39ff-4c46-a39b-167c7fa78940"></p><p data-ref="a7811613-8027-4464-aa25-80409abbd6d2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Circle <strong data-ref="20ebdf57-80ae-4248-85c1-55ebddc319e4">Class</strong></p><ul data-ref="abcd679b-775f-4a1e-b839-968db085371d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="0431e728-f824-4da6-a55a-48ba239829b9">Create a class named <strong data-ref="973ff4b9-7b16-4b52-bd53-7928150df63a">Circle</strong> that 