er-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="e3c08d46-2e76-4cdb-a2ea-f5f6eea7f28a">1. Define the GoodMorning thread class</strong></p><p data-ref="a0fde398-9e64-4dfd-9983-89f3442c1cbe" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">1. Create a class named <strong data-ref="87dc59ab-a9af-41d3-9a9d-c7f91643d8c1">GoodMorning</strong> that extends <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="33a210d5-28ee-4714-90d6-fa59c72d52af">Thread</span>.</p><p data-ref="dc3e414b-61d9-4705-b9c6-decb91b384bb" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">2. Accept the number of repetitions as a parameter through the constructor.</p><p data-ref="ad2aaf8c-43d6-466f-a464-1a7edf6d1e71" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">3. Override the <span class="ql-font-monosp