ata-ref="abade8b2-6508-431b-b8f0-5672c7474f1a" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="e3190c60-5d3d-4c20-8d51-5daee9b9d324"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="024c70b6-c28a-41a0-ae5f-126d87cdfe8a"><p data-ref="6176f59e-8671-4faf-8932-619febb651f6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Create a Java program that demonstrates the use of user and daemon threads. Implement a class <strong data-ref="04d58d5d-e458-4deb-ac60-373dad2c79ac">WorkerThread</strong> that extends <strong data-ref="f53f8921-d266-4aeb-8598-36c6e8dd5716">Thread</strong> and overrides the <strong data-ref="77e40690-01c0-4dca-9719-7120365be096">run</strong> method to simulate some work by printing messages and sleeping for a short duration.</p><p data-ref="c11a67ea-6c5a-47de-979b-8fee7666dc06" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="0ce8b9df-bf57-4bdf-80b4-1c7830c7d286"></p><p data-ref="b1dce421-933e-47e3-8293-bcfb32785af5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">In the <strong data-ref="e7e83d30-5e6d-491a-a895-0b7173ee53b7">DaemonThread</strong> class:</p><p data-ref="b3f0c710-9c20-4424-ac7b-e9a1a07c3c1a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">1. Prompt the user to input the number of user threads and daemon threads.</p><p data-ref="f21f31dd-4bd6-4814-8fdc-17d132cfb1e7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">2. Create and start the specified number of user threads and daemon threads.</p><ul data-ref="f8b8d8a8-7bb5-4e1f-9d9d-061a6107aee3" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="0096c5e6-4bac-4b84-95ef-240f714f996f"><strong data-ref="3022425c-80fd-4450-83c9-d3c56216750e">User Threads: </strong>These threads will run to completion and are not interrupted by the main thread.<strong data-ref="ec91e455-b41e-4336-bc72-04464903636c">Daemon Threads:</strong> These threads will run in the background and may be terminated abruptly when the main thread exits.</li></ul><p data-ref="9f7c4849-b698-4bc6-9b12-e3fa27aee99d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">3. The main thread should print a message indicating its exit after creating the threads.</p><p data-ref="aee2e750-91d7-4709-9375-b6fd3e254734" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="83360206-3f0c-4068-a4b5-eb4d13d36b36"></p><p data-ref="e6a6b3c5-3f94-4817-8b86-279c893da70d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="51721220-8a8a-4e93-ab3f-74ca17758798">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="df887dda-c054-429a-95fc-c0b8205234de" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="92b484c2-1422-41e3-a91b-40d5e38fcaf3">The first line contains an integer specifying the number of user threads.</li><li data-ref="c7cccdb9-cdc9-46d5-b78c-307514ab2f25">The second line contains an integer specifying the number of daemon threads.</li></ul><p data-ref="07e91a03-b903-4ee2-8225-29caf76a2d54" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="23c51719-c88f-4121-be44-e059ea2976b1"></p><p data-ref="46e8db04-1731-42e3-b4ca-0cc2803dba05" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="710fc48c-44c6-4429-9572-561ac0d5e6bf">Output Format:</strong></p><p data-ref="b68c8adf-9efc-4977-a904-662fde3d9e81" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The output should display the following:</p><ul data-ref="5e16b62b-bbef-4426-97a8-21a44b2f41bd" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="200e5fc1-ee3c-490c-a9ed-0691fdaa1a53">Messages indicating the <strong data-ref="59e3a097-3c74-4ec8-8317-417b13ad4ec4">start</strong> and <strong data-ref="868e3fac-152f-46fa-8146-74148f890917">finish</strong> of each user thread.</li><li data-ref="83aecdb9-e71d-44b9-bc31-f6e35d81b0aa">Messages indicating the <strong data-ref="e78b5a46-3df0-42ab-adaf-b5a5e486eb35">start</strong> and <strong data-ref="f2cbc3e1-00da-4e44-b20e-b3c3c9f2e85b">finish</strong> of each daemon thread.</li><li data-ref="b5bdd86b-1dd8-44f2-8173-3e86f3b3e2f9">A message indicating that the main thread is exiting as: "Main thread exiting".</li></ul><p data-ref="5e9d0f74-c2cd-41f1-afa6-69e552353a12" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="411c4e90-897a-4ccd-85bf-42cc20fdf738"></p><p data-ref="01e08217-1e86-4415-837a-969ac877c2dd" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="7b01015f-c565-4457-a5e7-42dbef9ee966">Note:</strong></p><ul data-ref="12d6ccb1-e0f7-4529-8a25-a3907d448845" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="75e9b0cd-197f-4fbb-ba9f-84d3e441deaf">Ensure that daemon threads are correctly set using <strong data-ref="4032cee5-76b7-4049-ae9e-1f516c0939b5">setDaemon(true) </strong>before calling <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="839ee64a-0e63-4027-a6ed-c51a16df149f">start()</span><