der-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="152f2af5-e7b9-4a69-9fce-bac535becabb" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="56adddff-0d19-4a6d-8fc1-416774bf86bf"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="57a719ad-7809-427a-bc24-61a8171e4f30"><p data-ref="2f6ca9ef-6104-48d8-9597-b69f2e6942a0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program that creates two threads, <strong data-ref="60607ee4-16c5-4382-9938-884baecfec2e">FirstThread</strong> and <strong data-ref="c7a003f7-bb59-4099-9826-c1394b4ad27d">SecondThread</strong>, to print messages a specified number of times with a 100 ms delay.</p><ul data-ref="c4a6f0a4-8ae6-4253-b1aa-caa43533dd55" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="1d02ea57-8773-4c7c-bc78-2cb5f5e8f77b">The program should prompt the user to enter the number of messages for the First Thread and the Second Thread.</li><li data-ref="703e752a-bc09-4ae4-9b48-8ed2bd5ef33d"><strong data-ref="7f279920-d58c-46bf-9f3c-1f1fb11f3013">FirstThread</strong> should print messages as “Message from First Thread: &lt;i&gt;” where &lt;i&gt; is the current iteration.</li><li data-ref="66606078-148b-454c-9497-45755fc73f40"><strong data-ref="a56d71c2-c4b7-40d6-9c9a-0487ad6a2dff">SecondThread</strong> should print messages as “Message from Second Thread: &lt;i&gt;” where &lt;i&gt; is the current iteration.</li><li data-ref="c936e976-c08b-416d-b322-f52befb9c632">The main thread should:</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="30cf4db3-1de6-4454-ace1-33d07ed50cde">Start both threads using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="575722d6-9cdd-40d3-999d-f2eeb1d27595">start()</span>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="b4473b81-a9e4-46ed-95ce-9fb230d7c039">Display their alive status using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="3f5a117e-9217-4917-871a-cf33f0758cc5">isAlive()</span>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="79c7953c-a96a-4b19-ad44-839678186362">Wait for each thread to finish using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="9025fe43-ec8d-4668-a0e7-a7e5cdb89db4">join()</span>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="97038b39-ecf4-4d6b-b259-1061bf735739">Display messages while waiting and after completion.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="4f0f0d1b-8891-4050-80da-ebd1087e09cd">Verify and display the alive status of threads after they complete.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="f4b0c2bb-c60b-4c90-94fd-4150d83cec1a">Print a final message indicating the main thread has finished.</li><li data-ref="99251ef3-d013-4aed-88e7-f262ec038579">Both threads should properly handle <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="e7b5f22d-e632-47b9-bbb0-f65620247113">InterruptedException</span> during sleep.</li></ul><p data-ref="b092ac46-3380-4e85-83b4-77297837aa8f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="c3a5457c-d781-431b-b4f7-9d2257bb16e6"></p><p data-ref="d6911e21-01bf-440f-89bb-86e5fa1b430d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" da